STEP13_DECL_KIND DurfeeCCS.Step10.outerAlternating_of_estimates theorem DurfeeCCS.Step10.OuterSigns
DurfeeCCS.Step10.outerAlternating_of_estimates (hApprox : DurfeeCCS.Step10.OuterBesselApproximation)
